---
layout: default
---
<div class="robin-home">
  <section class="v2-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="v2-hero-copy">
      <p class="v2-eyebrow">ROBIN INHO KEE · UNIVERSITY OF MICHIGAN ROBOTICS</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Robot teams that reason, communicate, and adapt.</h1>
      <p class="v2-hero-lead">
        I am a Ph.D. student in Robotics at the University of Michigan. I develop multi-robot autonomy that identifies what information matters,
        communicates under real network constraints, and adapts team behavior as the mission context changes.
      </p>

      <div class="v2-actions">
        <a class="v2-btn v2-btn-primary" href="{{ '/Researches & Projects/' | relative_url }}">Explore research</a>
        <a class="v2-btn" href="{{ '/Publications/' | relative_url }}">Publications</a>
        <a class="v2-btn" href="{{ '/CV/' | relative_url }}">CV</a>
      </div>

      <div class="v2-inline-links" aria-label="External profiles">
        {% if site.scholar_userid -%}
          <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user={{ site.scholar_userid }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Scholar ↗</a>
        {%- endif %}
        {% if site.github_username -%}
          <a href="https://github.com/{{ site.github_username }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a>
        {%- endif %}
        {% if site.linkedin_username -%}
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/{{ site.linkedin_username }}/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn ↗</a>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="v2-hero-visual">
      <div class="v2-profile-frame">
        <img src="{{ 'assets/img/Umich_pic.jpg' | relative_url }}" alt="Robin Inho Kee" loading="eager">
      </div>
      <div class="v2-profile-note">
        <span class="v2-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>Multi-Robot Systems · Adaptive Communication · Safe Autonomy</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="v2-section" aria-labelledby="focus-title">
    <div class="v2-section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="v2-eyebrow">CURRENT FOCUS</p>
        <h2 id="focus-title">From mission context to coordinated robot behavior.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        My research connects mission-aware reasoning, adaptive communication, and resilient execution so robot teams can act on the right information
        without assuming perfect connectivity.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="v2-focus-grid">
      <article class="v2-focus-card">
        <span class="v2-focus-index">01</span>
        <h3>Mission-aware reasoning</h3>
        <p>Turn observations and mission context into the information and priorities that should change team behavior.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="v2-focus-card">
        <span class="v2-focus-index">02</span>
        <h3>Adaptive communication</h3>
        <p>Decide what to communicate, when, and with whom under finite range, bandwidth, and interference.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="v2-focus-card">
        <span class="v2-focus-index">03</span>
        <h3>Predictive & resilient execution</h3>
        <p>Use predictive models and safety-aware control to anticipate communication risk, agent loss, and changing environments.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="v2-section" aria-labelledby="work-title">
    <div class="v2-section-head v2-section-head-row">
      <div>
        <p class="v2-eyebrow">SELECTED WORK</p>
        <h2 id="work-title">Research foundations for the next autonomy stack.</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="v2-text-link" href="{{ '/Researches & Projects/' | relative_url }}">View all research →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="v2-featured-work">
      <a class="v2-work-card v2-work-card-featured" href="{{ '/projects/research-2026-09-21-ACDC/' | relative_url }}">
        <div class="v2-work-art v2-work-art-network" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="v2-network-ring ring-a"></span><span class="v2-network-ring ring-b"></span> <span class="v2-network-node node-a"></span
          ><span class="v2-network-node node-b"></span> <span class="v2-network-node node-c"></span><span class="v2-network-node node-d"></span>
          <strong>AC-DC</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="v2-work-copy">
          <p class="v2-card-meta">2026 · Multi-Robot Systems</p>
          <h3>Adaptive Communication for Scalable Dynamic Average Consensus</h3>
          <p>Robots jointly decide <strong>who</strong> to communicate with, <strong>when</strong>, and <strong>what</strong> state to exchange.</p>
          <span class="v2-card-cta">Project page →</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="v2-work-card" href="{{ '/projects/research-2024-02-01-Panagou-ICRA/' | relative_url }}">
        <div class="v2-work-image">
          <img src="{{ 'assets/img/DASC_ICRA2025/ICRA_overview.webp' | relative_url }}" alt="Online Adaptive ICCBF project preview" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="v2-work-copy">
          <p class="v2-card-meta">ICRA 2025 · Safe Learning & Control</p>
          <h3>Online Adaptive Input Constrained Control Barrier Functions</h3>
          <p>Learning-based online adaptation of safety constraints with uncertainty-aware verification.</p>
          <span class="v2-card-cta">Project page →</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="v2-work-card" href="{{ '/projects/research-2026-04-01-OA-CBF/' | relative_url }}">
        <div class="v2-work-art v2-work-art-oa" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="v2-oa-orbit orbit-a"></span>
          <span class="v2-oa-orbit orbit-b"></span>
          <span class="v2-oa-candidate candidate-a"></span>
          <span class="v2-oa-candidate candidate-b"></span>
          <span class="v2-oa-candidate candidate-c"></span>
          <strong>OA-CBF</strong>
          <small>QUERY · VALIDATE · ADAPT</small>
        </div>
        <div class="v2-work-copy">
          <p class="v2-card-meta">2026 Preprint · Safe Learning & Control</p>
          <h3>Online Adaptive Control Barrier Functions</h3>
          <p>Query and validate CBF parameters online under epistemic and aleatoric uncertainty.</p>
          <span class="v2-card-cta">Project page →</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="v2-section v2-about-section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="v2-about-label">
      <p class="v2-eyebrow">ABOUT</p>
      <h2 id="about-title">Research across multi-robot systems, safe control, and learning.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="v2-about-copy">
      {{ content }}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
